<h1>Health</h1>
<p>{{found}} manifests found · {{valid}} valid · {{invalid}} invalid. Status: {{statusLine}}. Publication logs: {{pubLogs}} of {{valid}}.</p>
<h2>Invalid manifests ({{invalidCount}})</h2>
{{#invalidRows}}{{#first}}<table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Path<th scope="col">Why</tr></thead><tbody>{{/first}}<tr><td>{{path}}<td>{{kind}}: {{reason}}</tr>{{#last}}</tbody></table>{{/last}}{{/invalidRows}}{{^invalidRows}}<p class="note">None.</p>{{/invalidRows}}
<h2>Folders with a .policy bundle but no manifest ({{uncCount}})</h2><ul>{{#unc}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{/unc}}</ul>
<h2>YAML files that look like manifests but are not ({{lookCount}})</h2><ul>{{#look}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{/look}}</ul>
<h2>Warnings</h2>{{#warnGroups}}<details><summary>{{kind}} ({{n}})</summary><ul>{{#items}}<li>{{path}}: {{detail}}</li>{{/items}}</ul></details>{{/warnGroups}}
